1. BUGS IDENTIFIED & SQUASHED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. [CRITICAL] Reversion of Active Trailing Stops & MTF Risk Walls:
   - Root cause: An earlier editor session buffer in memory did not have `manage_trailing_stops()` and the H1 trend wall.
