   Evidence: `system_errors.log` line references (line 242) don't match HEAD code. Last error was
   2026-10-02 00:26 UTC -- 16+ hours ago, yet bot is still running and producing trades.
   Root cause: Bot was never restarted after commit 739612f. Python caches modules at process start.
